# Secrets for the cf-orbs Worker. The Deploy to Cloudflare setup page prompts for every
# uncommented entry below and sets it as a Worker secret, so only the one the first
# deploy genuinely needs is uncommented.

# Your Amp provider token (aop_live_…). Make it in Amp → Settings → Orbs → Add Provider
# and note the provider name you type there; you paste it on the setup page.
AMP_ORB_PROVIDER_TOKEN=

# Optional, only for the cf-orbs CLI (status, logs, doctor): bearer token for the control
# API. Leave commented for a set-it-and-forget-it install; to use the CLI later, run
# `npx cf-orbs init --no-deploy --adopt` in your clone.
# CONTROL_TOKEN=
